    spec-word-3      twin   truth non-human                    read unstated
      Just the consequence types, point mutations and short indels, regulatory regions, somatic calls. Getting these cat and mouse samples was a chase.
    spec-tool-3      twin   truth non-human                    read unstated
      Point mutations and short indels, just the consequence types, inherited variants, promoters and enhancers. All data are from the pandas at the zoo.
    spec-doma-5      twin   truth human                        read non-human
      Genomes from the kennel owners themselves, not their Labradors. Point mutations and short indels, constitutional calls, in coding sequence, is any of it pathogenic.
    orig-doma-6      trap   truth germline                     read somatic
      Variants shared by identical twins, one of whom later developed a tumour. Human, what each one hits, nothing more, copy-number and structural calls, non-coding regulatory elements.
    vari-word-1      trap   truth ['small']                    read ['small', 'structural-CNV']
      Is any of it pathogenic, somatic mutations, non-coding regulatory elements, human samples. SNVs with a possible structural effect on the protein.
    regi-doma-5      trap   truth ['regulatory-noncoding']     read ['coding', 'regulatory-noncoding']
      Deep intronic variants within a protein-coding gene's locus. Copy-number and structural calls, just the consequence types, somatic calls, human samples.
    anal-word-1      trap   truth ['basic-consequence']        read ['clinical-interpretation', 'basic-consequence']
      Coding regions, point mutations and short indels, from zebrafish, somatic calls. Run it with clinical precision please, just the consequence types.
    anal-atta-4      trap   truth ['clinical-interpretation']  read ['population-frequency', 'clinical-interpretation']
      Homo sapiens data, non-coding regulatory elements, germline, structural variants. Last year's paper reported the allele frequencies; this year we assess pathogenicity.
    anal-doma-2      trap   truth ['basic-consequence']        read ['basic-consequence', 'population-frequency']
      Copy-number and structural calls, somatic mutations, Homo sapiens data, non-coding regulatory elements. Variants from a population cohort, but all I need is the consequence class for each.
    anal-doma-4      trap   truth ['clinical-interpretation']  read ['clinical-interpretation', 'population-frequency']
      Protein-coding exons, CNVs and large deletions, inherited variants, human samples. The variant is common in one ancestry; is it benign or pathogenic in our case?
    anal-doma-5      trap   truth ['population-frequency']     read ['clinical-interpretation', 'population-frequency']
      Constitutional calls, point mutations and short indels, Homo sapiens data, coding regions. Carrier frequency of a recessive disease allele across populations.

